OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Clara
OL,12,G     Schumann and her Circle
OL,13,     F5/5. Donald Macleod meets the
OL,14,     Ffriends (and foes) of composer
OL,15,     FClara Schumann. Today, we explore
OL,16,     Fthe women who are often erased
OL,17,     Ffrom Clara's life story.
